<title>HONG KONG: Vanda unit to distribute IBM products in China.</title>
<headline>Vanda unit to distribute IBM products in China.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vanda Systems and Communications Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday its unit Azure Technology Ltd had been appointed as main distributor for mid-range IBM computers in China.</p>
<p>The deal covers products in four categories, including low-end RS/6000, low-end AS/400, POS systems and system storage products, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>--HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 28436441</p>
</text>
